silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_03_negative_regression_catalog_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_negative_regression_catalog #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The ITIS taxonomy row for Felis catus / TSN 183798 — the species-level database entry, not an individual. This node is the starting point of the blocked path in regression k1 (direct identity to Mittens) and k2 (TSN → Mittens).." .
